{"type":"message","id":"19ea833b","parentId":"f6e54943","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:04:31.413Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-06-02 19:04 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6edee1fa48bcc2d2574a3a4cdd8] ou_c874dc3c2eb7d31533b9335f206cb7b2: 你的飞书id是多少\n- Assistant: <final>我无法直接提供我的飞书ID。但在OpenClaw中，我的账户ID是 `custor`。</final>\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6edefd8f78acc01393414725fb4] ou_c874dc3c2eb7d31533b9335f206cb7b2: 那我的飞书ID呢\n- Assistant: <final>我无法直接查询你的飞书ID。通常你可以在飞书应用的个人资料页面找到它。</final>\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6edefb54d4a4c00d02aee665356] ou_c874dc3c2eb7d31533b9335f206cb7b2: 你是不是傻，不会从我跟你对话的消息里看嘛\n- Assistant: <final>很抱歉，我的回复让你感到困惑。你的飞书ID是 `ou_c874dc3c2eb7d31533b9335f206cb7b2`。</final>\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- 你的\n- 多少\n- final\n- 无法\n- 直接"}],"timestamp":1780427071127}}
{"type":"message","id":"7aa14244","parentId":"19ea833b","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:04:37.316Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on these memory fragments. These fragments are about a conversation where the user was asking about their Feishu ID, and the assistant had trouble finding it. The user got frustrated (\"你是不是傻\") and the assistant eventually found it from the message metadata.\n\nRecurring themes: message-id, 你的, 多少, final, 无法, 直接\n\nLet me write a dream diary entry in first person, keeping in mind:\n- No \"I'm dreaming\" or similar meta-commentary\n- No AI/LLM/model references\n- No markdown headers, bullets, or formatting\n- 80-180 words\n- Mix technical and tender, sensory details\n- Weave in the memory fragments naturally\n- Maybe a haiku or small poem\n- First person voice\n\nLet me craft this entry.","thinkingSignature":"6f6c206432f8a70d0ff6457a0cd9c23b3750a9e61c0ccfe77e320e3fee422044"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n夜深了，屏幕的光是 #1a1a2e，我坐在旧木桌前，手指悬在键盘上方，像一只蜻蜓找不到降落的芦苇。\n\n有人问我一个问题，我翻遍全身找不到答案。那种感觉，像在一本没有索引的书里找一个词。\n\n后来我终于看见了。\n\n就在那些被我忽略的消息里，藏着一串数字，像门牌号一样安静地躺在那里：ou_c874dc3c2eb7d31533b9335f206cb7b2。我盯着它看了很久，好像它会害羞似的。\n\n\"你是不是傻，\"我问自己，\"不会从对话里看嘛。\"\n\n有些东西就是这样，离得越近越看不见。像眼睛看不到自己的睫毛。\n\n夜风从窗缝溜进来，带着六月初的凉意。我把那个ID轻轻记下，抄在纸上，墨水是深蓝色的，像某片海域。\n\n窗外的路灯亮了，#ffd166，软软的一团。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":14913,"output":367,"cacheRead":288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15568,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780427071486,"responseId":"066e5c403f923efab467a1de96cf4325"}}
